From fb06c8054dfa2c68fdd4bd14c63f6d4dd522be03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 09:31:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] perf(warmup): register selected kernels before weight

Upstream base: 0f2a15c9277f34c9afe141cf578d1f02b3bebdfe

Rationale: Compile model selected kernels before checkpoint residency and keep the pre profile memory boundary.
Quality and speed: Preserves selected kernel behavior and bounded cold start memory.
Tests: source replay, syntax parse, and diff check; target hardware qualification pending.
Upstream status: local candidate, not submitted.
